abstract: >-
  Analysis code, result tables and specifications for a same-acquisition study of
  the reproducibility of automated whole-heart and great-vessel CT volumes
  (TotalSegmentator) across reconstruction kernels, executed by an agent workflow
  with executable checks. The six analytical modules run without language-model
  or platform calls; a standalone script reproduces the scoring results.
